  {
    "id": "tate01-perfume-launch-2026",
    "categories": ["milestones"],
    "is_historical_milestone": true,
    "title": "TATE 01 Perfume Release",
    "hero_title_type": "image",
    "hero_title_image": "images/tate01.svg",
    "type_label": "PRODUCT LAUNCH",
    "text_content": {
      "type": "quote_artist",
      "text": "I wanted to create a scent that feels bold, a bit nostalgic, and captures the exact mood of being under the lights.",
      "author": "Tate McRae"
    },
    "date": {
      "raw": "2026-10-28",
      "display": "01.10.2026",
      "full": "October 1, 2026",
      "is_confirmed": true
    },
    "media_type": "single_photo",
    "hero_media": [
      {
        "id": "hero_perfume",
        "url": "images/milestones/tate01.jpg",
        "object_position": "center center"
      }
    ],
    "timeline_media": {
      "url": "images/milestones/tate01line.jpg",
      "colors": {
        "bg_primary": "#ebe3da",
        "bg_secondary": "#f5f5f5",
        "text_main": "#000000",
        "accent_ball": "#b6b8ba"
      }
    },
    "action_buttons": [
      { "type": "buy", "label": "SHOP FRAGRANCE", "url": "https://www.tatebytm.com/products/eau-de-parfum?Format=100+ml"}
    ],
    "long_content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Marking her first major entrepreneurial venture outside of music, Tate McRae officially introduced her debut fragrance, TATE 01, in late October 2026. Designed to mirror her personal artistic evolution, the perfume features an edgy yet clean scent profile."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The launch campaign featured stunning minimalist and dark editorial photography, heavily influencing the deep tones and layouts utilized across her dynamic platforms."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "housewife-single-2026",
    "categories": ["milestones"],
    "is_historical_milestone": true,
    "title": "Housewife",
    "type_label": "SINGLE",
    "text_content": {
      "type": "quote_artist",
      "text": "It’s kind of about a woman who can’t be contained",
      "author": "Tate McRae"
    },
    "date": {
      "raw": "2026-10-15",
      "display": "15.10.2026",
      "full": "October 15, 2026",
      "is_confirmed": true
    },
    "media_type": "single_photo",
    "hero_media": [
      {
        "id": "hero_1",
        "url": "images/milestones/housewife.webp",
        "object_position": "center 20%"
      }
    ],
    "timeline_media": {
      "url": "images/milestones/housewife.webp",
      "colors": {
        "bg_primary": "#46401f",
        "bg_secondary": "#982122",
        "text_main": "#dab194",
        "accent_ball": "#b1b1af"
      }
    },
    "action_buttons": [
      { "type": "watch", "label": "WATCH NOW", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DPEodkHzH-s" },
      { "type": "buy", "label": "BUY CD/VINYL", "url": "https://tatemcrae.lnk.to/housewife" }
    ],
    "long_content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Housewife marked a clear shift in Tate McRae’s visual language. The single leaned into a more cinematic, almost editorial aesthetic that felt closer to high fashion than traditional pop videos."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Shot on a private estate, the visual narrative focused on isolation and quiet tension. The color palette from this era later became the foundation for the website’s dynamic theming system."
      },
      {
        "type": "quote",
        "text": "I wanted something that felt both intimate and slightly dangerous.",
        "author": "Tate McRae"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The track itself balances vulnerability with a sharp, confident delivery — a combination that has defined much of her recent work."
      }
    ]
  },
